exports[`red flags of the listing page (PAR-02 resto) > renders «Conviene verificar» with the new flags (snapshot) 1`] = `"<ul class="mt-2" data-testid="red-flags"><li data-flag="duplicate_photos" class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-2.5 border-b py-2.5 text-[15px] last:border-b-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle mt-0.5 size-4 text-warn" aria-label="Importante"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 break-words font-semibold text-warn">Las fotos de esta publicación aparecen también en otra publicación (Rosario Garage) con otros datos: conviene pedir fotos actuales y ver el auto antes de señar.<a class="ml-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-normal text-foreground underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary" data-testid="duplicate-link" href="/app/listings/501">Ver la otra publicación</a></span></li><li data-flag="private_many_listings" class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-2.5 border-b py-2.5 text-[15px] last:border-b-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-4 text-faint" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 break-words">El vendedor tiene 7 publicaciones activas: conviene preguntar si es titular.</span></li><li data-flag="cross_source_duplicate" class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-2.5 border-b py-2.5 text-[15px] last:border-b-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-4 text-faint" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 break-words">Parece el mismo auto publicado también en Mercado Libre (mismas fotos): conviene comparar las dos publicaciones.<a href="https://auto.mercadolibre.com.ar/MLA-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ml-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-normal text-foreground underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-primary" data-testid="duplicate-link">Ver la otra publicación<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></span></li><li data-flag="no_owners" class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-2.5 border-b py-2.5 text-[15px] last:border-b-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-4 text-faint" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 break-words">El aviso no dice cuántos dueños tuvo.</span></li></ul>"`;
